==Strategy==
Whilst very similar structurally to the [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 33|Heavenly Tower's Floor 33]], the Crazed Cats here are now their tougher Manic counterparts. Additionally, Zapy applies additional pressure, and Those Guys/Jackie Peng show up semi-frequently as a cash source to better combat these threats.

Bear in mind that Zapy can one-shot your Wave Blockers; as such, bring something to help combat it, [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife]] with savage blow being quite useful. Otherwise, this stage plays very similarly to the original, including the efficacy of [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]] and [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]].

